        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodo Master was created to be a simple, charming, classical platformer where players take on the role of a Dodo who has escaped from her mysterious captors to reclaim her eggs. Journey through the deepest caves and the most terrifying dungeons whilst vanquishing a horde of dastardly enemies and the most cunning of Dodo-trapping devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/89c326da10fd99c7b25d160e09ea6280.poster.avif?t=1787558127\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/89c326da10fd99c7b25d160e09ea6280.webm?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/89c326da10fd99c7b25d160e09ea6280.mp4?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 uniquely crafted Levels hidden behind 20 doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school platforming fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 3D art style full of character and whimsey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Richly detailed and textured sound design full of subtleties that enhance the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unlockable bonus items to add humour and a customised appearance to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/a16a99ff1a9782efe6928cd209a44afd.poster.avif?t=1787558127\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/a16a99ff1a9782efe6928cd209a44afd.webm?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/a16a99ff1a9782efe6928cd209a44afd.mp4?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodo Master was created to be a simple, charming, classical platformer where players take on the role of a Dodo who has escaped from her mysterious captors to reclaim her eggs. Journey through the deepest caves and the most terrifying dungeons whilst vanquishing a horde of dastardly enemies and the most cunning of Dodo-trapping devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/89c326da10fd99c7b25d160e09ea6280.poster.avif?t=1787558127\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/89c326da10fd99c7b25d160e09ea6280.webm?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/89c326da10fd99c7b25d160e09ea6280.mp4?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >80 uniquely crafted Levels hidden behind 20 doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Old school platforming fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charming 3D art style full of character and whimsey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Richly detailed and textured sound design full of subtleties that enhance the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unlockable bonus items to add humour and a customised appearance to the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/a16a99ff1a9782efe6928cd209a44afd.poster.avif?t=1787558127\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/a16a99ff1a9782efe6928cd209a44afd.webm?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4156050/extras/a16a99ff1a9782efe6928cd209a44afd.mp4?t=1787558127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
